                                "example_id": "51b7b5c0-0e43-4eaa-b4fd-855def6994a1",
                                "sense_id": "13b07345-03dc-3607-b0ac-b7bd7f7e58e3",
                                "text": "How one repairs a broken sled, the quickest way to unfoul the dog lines, how to prevent the dogs from tangling the lines after stops, and so on."
